WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Masking is applied to the memorial body before finishing.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A gold-colored finish is sprayed onto the masked wing-shaped component.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Close views show the gold-colored finish and shaped details before final assembly.

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
